    "transcript_summary": "The agent, identifying as David Miller, initiated the call to reschedule an appointment for the upcoming Thursday due to a work conflict, aiming to move it to the following week. The user attempted to verify his identity, initially mistaking him for Maria. David provided his full name, date of birth (January 1, 1985), and spelled out his name. He then confirmed his phone number (555-123-4567) for record lookup. However, the user was unable to find his record and attempted to transfer him to patient support. The call ended abruptly during the transfer, and the agent's appointment was not rescheduled.",
